<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47492" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tarbelli</span></b> , ōrum,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				people in Aquitanian Gaul</i>, <i>extending
				southwards from Burdigala to the Pyrenees</i>, in the
			neighborhood of the mod. <i>Dax</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
				3, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 19, 33, § 108</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">31, 2, 2, §
			4</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tarbellus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>Tarbellian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pyrene,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 7, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mater,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Parent. 2, 2</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tarbellĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Tarbellian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aequor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					1, 421</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tar-bellĭcus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Tarbellian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aturus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the river Adour</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Mos. 468</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 24, 125</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">origo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Prof. 16, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
